                            rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                            rdfs:comment "This code list class provides the CementationFabricValue codes."@en ;
                            rdfs:label "Code list for CementationFabricValue - codelist class"@en ;
                            rdfs:seeAlso :CementationFabricValueCollection ;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Classification of the fabric of the cemented/compacted layer. See more in Guidelines for Soil Description issued by the FAO: table 70" .


###  http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/CementationNatureValueCode
:CementationNatureValueCode rdf:type owl:Class ;
                            owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  owl:oneOf ( :cementationNatureValueCode-C
                                                              :cementationNatureValueCode-CS
                                                              :cementationNatureValueCode-F
                                                              :cementationNatureValueCode-FM
                                                              :cementationNatureValueCode-FO
                                                              :cementationNatureValueCode-GY
