                          rdfs:seeAlso :ErosionCategoryValueCollection ;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Erosion can be classified as water or wind erosion and include off-site effects such as deposition, a third major category is mass movements (landslides and related phenomena). See more in Guidelines for Soil Description issued by the FAO: table 16" .


