                        rdfs:seeAlso :FragmentsSizeValueCollection ;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Classes of occurrence of coarse surface fragments are correlated with the ones for rock outcrop. See more in guidelines for Soil Description issued by the FAO: table 15,2" .


###  http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/GypsumContentValueCode
:GypsumContentValueCode rdf:type owl:Class ;
