:bulkDensityMineralValueCode-BD5 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                          :BulkDensityMineralValueCode ,
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                                 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> :BulkDensityMineralValueCollection ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Loamy soils with high clay content, clayey soils. Sample remains intact when dropped, no further disintegration after application of very large pressure." ;
