                            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> :ErosionCategoryValueCollection ;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mass movements are defined as processes of erosion, transport and accumulation of material that occur on both gentle and steep slopes mainly owing to gravitational forces." ;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/> ;
